     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">What is <a href=\"http://ploidy.mean.cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ploidy.mean.cn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481707865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YvzG_CElL92X6jnR7uJ_1\">ploidy.mean.cn</a>?<br><br>I have in output *confints_CP.txt content like:<br><br>&quot;cellularity&quot;   &quot;ploidy.estimate&quot;       &quot;<a href=\"http://ploidy.mean.cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ploidy.mean.cn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481707865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YvzG_CElL92X6jnR7uJ_1\">ploidy.mean.cn</a>&quot;<br>0.57    4.6     3.78929274622115<br>0.61    5.6     3.78929274622115<br>0.66    6.6     3.78929274622115<br><br><br>what is the <a href=\"http://ploidy.mean.cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ploidy.mean.cn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481707865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YvzG_CElL92X6jnR7uJ_1\">ploidy.mean.cn</a>? Is it mean of all segments?<br><br>And shall I take the ploidy.estimate 4.6, since it is closest to the <a href=\"http://ploidy.mean.cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ploidy.mean.cn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792481707865000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YvzG_CElL92X6jnR7uJ_1\">ploidy.mean.cn</a>?<br><br></div>"
    ]
